Spec: Admin Frontend Web (Angular)
Purpose: Modern Web UI for managing and monitoring the MitM Data Aggregator.

Platform: Angular v22 / TypeScript

Structure:
  ./src/
  ./public/

Owns:
  ./**

Must:
  Communicate securely via HTTPS with the core-layer REST API.
  Provide responsive design suitable for desktop and tablet usage.

Must:
  The frontend must automatically renew active sessions in the background (e.g. every 30 minutes) to prevent premature timeouts during active use.
  The frontend must explicitly check for and gracefully parse backend JSON:API error messages for rejected logins (e.g., inactive users).
  Sign-in and registration use the WebAuthn passkey ceremony (`/api/v1/auth/webauthn/*`) via `@simplewebauthn/browser`; a session token is only stored after `login/finish` or the bootstrap `register/finish`.
  The bootstrap token input is shown only while `/api/v1/auth/bootstrap/status` reports `bootstrap_required`.

Must not:
  Send a `client_ip` or call third-party services during authentication; the backend derives the client IP.
